---
source: crates/argus-core/tests/redirect_uri_corpus.rs
expression: out
---
https://*.example.com/cb       -> redirect_uri wildcards are not supported; register each URI exactly
https://example.com/*          -> redirect_uri wildcards are not supported; register each URI exactly
https://example.com/cb#frag    -> redirect_uri must not contain a fragment (RFC 6749 §3.1.2)
/relative/cb                   -> redirect_uri must be an absolute URI (RFC 6749 §3.1.2)
not a uri                      -> redirect_uri must be an absolute URI (RFC 6749 §3.1.2)
                               -> redirect_uri must be an absolute URI (RFC 6749 §3.1.2)
http://evil.example.com/cb     -> plain http redirect_uri is only allowed on a loopback host (RFC 8252 §7.3)
http://10.0.0.5/cb             -> plain http redirect_uri is only allowed on a loopback host (RFC 8252 §7.3)
http://127.0.0.1:8080/cb       -> OK
http://localhost/cb            -> OK
http://[::1]/cb                -> OK
ftp://x.test/cb                -> redirect_uri scheme ftp is not allowed; use https, http on a loopback host, or a private-use scheme (RFC 8252 §7)
javascript:alert(1)            -> redirect_uri scheme javascript is not allowed; use https, http on a loopback host, or a private-use scheme (RFC 8252 §7)
data:text/html,x               -> redirect_uri scheme data is not allowed; use https, http on a loopback host, or a private-use scheme (RFC 8252 §7)
com.example.app:/oauth         -> OK
